# The sandbox's Claude Code state (login, session history, memory) - see ai-sandbox/README.md#persistence.
# ai-sandbox/sandbox.sh bind-mounts ai-sandbox-configuration/.claude-history INTO the sandbox container at
# /home/dev/.claude, so it survives a sandbox teardown. Holds OAuth tokens (.credentials.json), so it must never be
# committed.
.claude-history/
